  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Households in target communities have achieved food security and improved nutrition. Structuring and capacity building of community actors, awareness-raising, support for the nutritional care of children with enriched food mainly from local products. The drinking water supply systems will be developed for almost all the target communities. Family farm groups are established, trained and supported for climate-resilient sustainable agriculture production, seeds and other inputs and mechanisation; sustainable soil management and land regeneration for climate resilience. Focus is given to those in most vulnerable situations, such as women headed households, pregnant, lactating and women of childbearing age, children and youth, and people living with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
